# Step 5: Development
Input: feature page (architecture + test cases) + subtask issue. Output: PR.
- Implement exactly the page «Архитектура» for this subtask; automate marked test cases.
- Deviation needed: stop, propose a «Решения» row via the issue; do not code around the page.
- PR links the issue and names the page section implemented. Formats: `project-github-formats.mdc`.
